                  "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Call the existing MoE loader in the new test**\n\nIn this repo `llama4.py` exposes `Llama4Model.load_moe_expert_weights` and `Llama4ForCausalLM.load_weights`, but there is no `_load_moe_matrix` anywhere except this new test. As soon as `tests/models/test_llama4_moe.py` runs, this line raises `AttributeError` before validating the contiguity fix, so CI cannot pass for the added test; drive the actual loader method or update the call to the existing API.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L89-L91](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/5b61f54d8bc37c987192deef3135c620ddb89f22/AGENTS.md#L89-L91)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
